  "implementation": [
    "Service selects existing public event_waiter; no Core/API implementation changes, extra owner, callback or shared runtime.",
    "Owner initializes waiter after kernel/adapter; init failure rolls back both and preserves creation output.",
    "Auto-reset signals remain ordinary EventSet; work checks are followed by waiter wait without resetting the event.",
    "Owner releases waiter before STOPPED; failed release publishes FAILED and retains handle accounting. Exclusive Destroy after physical join retries before destroying kernel.",
    "Waiter backend/capacity persists; live timers report zero on normal stop. Inline waiter belongs to ArenaBytes; native handles remain outside requested-byte caps."
  ],
