      "ActiveNativeTimers"
    ],
    "function_signatures_unchanged": true
  },
  "regression": [
    "Real Core waiters under public-boundary init/wait/unit injection, budget balance and native-thread owner binding.",
    "Repeated cleanup failure leaves object inspectable/retryable; joined creator performs successful physical handoff.",
    "Windows unsupported high-resolution lookup forces actual standard timer fallback and validates backend metadata.",
    "64 service timer lifetimes return native process handle count to baseline after warmup.",
    "Existing OOM, 2048 warmed zero-requested-heap cycles, close races, retries, wall jumps, physical cancellation, data retirement and self-wait guards retained."
  ],
